{
  "TRANSACTION - FUNCTIONAL DESCRIPTION": "Modifies a pricing rule that is being used for payments on EVA platform",
  "EXECUTION FLOWS - DETAILED DESCRIPTION": "The transaction obtains the pricing rule identifier, the pricing rule request and the user code from the request header. It invokes ABKOR001.executePutPricingRules(pricingRuleId, pricingRuleRequest, auditUserId), which retrieves the existing pricing rule, validates that it can be modified, checks duplicate configurations, resolves detail values and updates the pricing rule and its details. The resulting PricingRuleDTO is assigned to pricingRuleResponse. If the transaction advice list is not empty after the library invocation, the transaction sets severity EWR.",
